---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import FinalCta from '../components/home/FinalCta.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="AI After-Hours Call Answering for Restoration Companies | Talkera Desk"
  description="Never lose an emergency water extraction job at 2 AM. AI phone agent that screens water damage severity, alerts on-call crews, and books into your CRM."
  canonicalUrl="https://talkeradesk.com/water-damage-restoration"
>
  <div class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-blue border border-sky-blue text-xs font-semibold text-deep-green uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-4">
          Restoration Industry Vertical
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight mb-4">
          After-hours calls for water and fire restoration companies.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          The emergency call comes at 2 AM. The homeowner's ceiling is actively leaking onto hardwood floors. The first company to pick up the phone wins the $3,500+ extraction job. Who answers your phone tonight?
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Life-Safety Triage Protocol (#B45309 Warning Box) -->
      <div class="my-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-2 border-warning text-ink max-w-4xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-warning text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            !
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-warning mb-1">
              Strict Life-Safety Emergency Protocol
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
              If an inbound caller reports active physical danger (electrical hazards near water, structural ceiling sag, gas odors, or trapped occupants), Talkera Desk immediately instructs the caller to hang up and dial emergency services (911) now. The agent simultaneously rings your on-call supervisor and dispatches priority SMS alerts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What the Agent Asks (Intake Checklist) -->
      <div class="my-20">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-deep-green/10 text-deep-green text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            Damage Intake Protocol
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-ink-deep">
            What the agent collects on every emergency call
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate mt-1">
            Standardized IICRC-aligned questions to equip your technicians before truck roll.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">01 / LOCATION</div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Verified Street Address</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">Cross-checked with caller ID and repeated for accuracy.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">02 / WATER CATEGORY</div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Source of Water Intrusion</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">Distinguishes clean supply pipe, appliance gray water, or sewage backup.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">03 / AFFECTED AREAS</div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Flooring & Structural Scope</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">Identifies flooded basements, wet drywall, hardwood, or carpets.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">04 / MAIN SHUTOFF</div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Active Flow Mitigation</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">Asks if the main water shut-off valve has been located and turned off.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">05 / INSURANCE CARRIER</div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Claim Status & Carrier</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">Captures whether an insurance claim has been initiated or policy name.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">06 / ESCALATION</div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Adjuster & Partner Routing</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">Commercial adjusters and plumbers are transferred to designated staff.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Restoration Sample Dialogue Card -->
      <div class="my-20 mercury-shell-light max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mercury-inner bg-deep-green text-white p-8 sm:p-10 noise-overlay">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-lime-accent font-bold mb-2">
            Real Scenario Sample &bull; 02:14 AM
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-white mb-6">
            Emergency Water Pipe Burst Triage
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/10">
              <span class="text-lime-accent font-bold">Caller:</span> "We have water pouring through our second-floor ceiling into our living room!"
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-green/30 border border-emerald-500/30">
              <span class="text-lime-accent font-bold">Talkera Desk:</span> "I'm Talkera Desk, an AI assistant for Apex Restoration. If anyone is in danger, hang up and dial 911. Is everyone safe?"
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/10">
              <span class="text-lime-accent font-bold">Caller:</span> "Everyone is safe, but it is spreading fast."
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-green/30 border border-emerald-500/30">
              <span class="text-lime-accent font-bold">Talkera Desk:</span> "Have you shut off the main water valve? I am holding our emergency extraction slot and dispatching Mike, our on-call tech, to 42 Oak St right now."
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-300">
            <span>Result: Urgent extraction held &bull; Tech Mike alerted by phone &bull; Jobber ticket created</span>
            <span class="text-lime-accent font-bold font-mono">P1 Dispatched</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Recommended Plan Fit -->
      <div class="my-20 p-8 rounded-panel bg-paper border border-sky-blue max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-ink-deep mb-2">Recommended Plan Fit for Restoration</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Restoration businesses can choose Growth at $383, Pro at $581 or Expansion at $950 a month, based on call volume and callers at once.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/pricing"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-deep-green text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-brand-green transition-all shadow"
        >
          View Restoration Plans & Rates &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <FinalCta />
</MainLayout>

